WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:01.629
Call me Ishmael.

2
00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:06.440
Some years ago—never mind how long precisely—having little or no money in my purse,

3
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.730
and nothing particular to interest me on shore, I thought I would sail about a little and see the watery

4
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.651
part of the world.

5
00:00:11.771 --> 00:00:15.434
It is a way I have of driving off the spleen and regulating the circulation.
